La-QJi3x98rktvloVo3G-KkBr8rK_IjA0LQEtmWk84WO5dWPkQBiT6Gk2IfUaPA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0zZICQzHX4NYJYzmoj6-tttbrNk3ER_v3KqO-r35iKJA&oe=69F09BBB"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates03cropped.png", "id": "337914812432265", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974774_337914815765598_1762840369253842605_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r3LN0feHQKAQ7kNvwEbdo0E&_nc_oc=AdoZ4vkIEA7XUAhkQXcqUA4EWdcKu5EeX-LIh3hIdciyJ1J-CJ5x8MAB7TcTNV6k8sE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1z1QbVuv0BPJhz4qv_vM92F6xVEiyFjUzH0zPy0M7U7g&oe=69F0CE61"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates04cropped.png", "id": "367552249204365", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_367552252537698_6058304213158592905_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jjo1Vkj2tgYQ7kNvwFCP-y0&_nc_oc=Adrk0Gi3t1y7822sT_aeChRdZXBeWBe-n6mYnoeizmByG3egifzYIo_cGtPUUzLZIek&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0Z3MRw6NHwKYLOw0h-pd9_IYJk1tDFV-4YjohvqWZbfQ&oe=69F0C4A5"}, {"file_name": "Chess cropped.png", "id": "902765531159168", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984463_902765534492501_3956653358745274292_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CSvgZNVSxv0Q7kNvwHEI-H_&_nc_oc=AdotqEbEAwLXXzOumMPUQrBvmUUtcfpaOsoWnF4NUfqvq9BU8wnoX0CIn_RS4z1jNjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0hbbRbPrJF_bv_cxcPUo5mxRjnO5KQzOFdjo6ml-bh6A&oe=69F0BFA3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerScreenshot cropped.png", "id": "717849803637730", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982545_717849806971063_8753740338935084738_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EIrobJiIF6EQ7kNvwGeGKto&_nc_oc=AdobLwts0BeFg8AtJJtbyJthET7fYHPvj_vn2_R6TFROJ214waU-ADi0Fhy-ZFjOSP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2Q75fVeuPDSF43O5E7VQTlVurLChho_z8cC-JRSFXlTg&oe=69F0A13B"}, "display_name": "VRShogiMates", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to VRShogiMates, your gateway to a captivating virtual realm of classic board games! As a solo developer's passion project, this app delivers an unparalleled experience featuring Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and the unique Gungi from Hunter X Hunter.\n\nMultiplayer Mode:\nChallenge opponents worldwide in real-time or correspondence matches. Whether facing friends or discovering new adversaries, the global multiplayer functionality ensures a dynamic and engaging experience.\n\nHow to play:\nNew to these intricate games? No problem! VRShogiMates provides comprehensive rules, instructions, and a game record for each game type to help you learn. Explore the rules, grasp essential strategies, and elevate your skills!\n\nRegular Updates and Support:\nMy commitment doesn't end at launch. Expect continuous updates, bug fixes, performance enhancements, and exciting new features driven by valuable feedback from us.\n\nUnique Highlights:\nVenture into the unexplored VR realms of Shogi, Chu Shogi, Xiangqi, and Gungi - experiences currently not offered by any other VR app on the market! The last game type, Gungi, brings a touch of fantasy to your gaming repertoire. It\u2019s refreshingly different from other board games, check it out!\n\nEmbark on this virtual journey, where tradition meets innovation, and every move is a step towards victory. VRShogiMates is not just a game; it's a portal to a world where strategy, competition, and community converge. Join us and redefine your board gaming experience!", "short_description": "Dive into the immersive world of board games with VRShogiMates! Play Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and Gungi in a stunning virtual environment. Challenge friends globally in real-time or turn-based multiplayer. Learn the rules for all the games, while enjoying regular updates for an ever-evolving gaming experience.\n\nInternet connection is required to play. (For now)\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "develop